{"asset_key":"ep5/env_story_15304540","episode":"ep5","category":"env_story","story_id":"15304540","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:3:1530454001:1":{"text":"당연히 관련이 있지. 보칼리스인이 아쿠보르를 침략했을 땐 사냥에 전혀 집중할 수 없었으니까.","source_cn":"当然了。那些呼临人进犯雅库伯尔的时候，我们根本没办法专...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6B1F4FB69E37C491","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1530454002:1":{"text":"특히 여기저기 숨어있는 보칼리스 병사들을 찾는 데 시간이 너무 많이 들었거든.","source_cn":"尤其是搜索那些到处躲藏的呼临士兵，实在太花费时间了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x46859A58D90CD8F4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1530454003:1":{"text":"맞아. 안 그래도 배고픈데 온 동네를 돌아다녀야 해서 짜증났어.","source_cn":"是啊，还没吃饱就到处跑的滋味可不好受！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE7722585312D0793","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:战士阿憨":{"text":"전사 아한","source":"战士阿憨","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:战士浩":{"text":"전사 하오","source":"战士浩","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":4,"localized_text_count":3,"speaker_count":2}}